+```
+
+If the consolidated commit contains all necessary work, proceed with force push:
+
+```bash
+git push --force-with-lease origin feature/sqlite-3.52-modernization
+```
+
+**Note**: `--force-with-lease` is safer than `--force` because it fails if someone else pushed to remote after your last fetch.
